{"4194930":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"D.U.C.K.","steam_appid":4194930,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game <\/strong>🦆<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protect the golden egg duck!<\/strong> Build your defenses, fit the shapes and stop the evil farmers before they strike.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>D.U.C.K.<\/strong> combines classic Tower Defense with a Tetris twist. Instead of simple towers, you place Tetris-shaped blocks. Fit them together to fill lines and trigger massive combos to survive the farmers' raid.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you strike the right balance between smart tower placement and completing powerful lines? Can you handle the unique challenges waiting across all 20 campaign levels?<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features 🐣<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Tetris Twist:<\/strong> Every tower has a unique shape. Strategically fit them together to fill lines and trigger powerful combos.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Campaign:<\/strong> 20 handcrafted levels, each with its own special challenge to test your strategy.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The World:<\/strong> 4 different biomes, each with its own unique gameplay mechanic to create new challenges.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability:<\/strong> A procedurally-generated mode to challenge your friends and see how long you can survive.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Mission:<\/strong> Stop the evil farmers from stealing your golden egg duck at all costs.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Notes 🥚<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bug reports:<\/strong> If you encounter bugs or have any ideas or feedback you would like to share, feel free to contact me at <strong><a hr